  "description": "Reid eMetro 250W eBike | Folding Electric Bike\nThe Reid eMetro eBike combines a compact folding design with electric assistance and practical features for everyday urban riding. Its alloy frame and sturdy steel fork provide a durable foundation, while the folding design makes storage more convenient when space is limited.\nPowered by a 250W Ananda rear hub motor and a 14.7Ah, 530Wh frame-mounted battery, the eMetro provides electric assistance for everyday journeys at speeds of up to 15.5mph. The Ananda D19 handlebar-mounted display features Bluetooth connectivity and app compatibility, keeping ride information accessible while you ride.\nThe 7-speed L-TWOO trigger shifter works with a Shimano TY200 rear derailleur and Shimano 14–28T freewheel to provide versatile gearing for city streets and cycle paths. Tektro HD-M275 hydraulic disc brakes deliver controlled stopping power, while 20 x 2.125-inch tyres mounted on double-wall rims provide grip and stability.\nCombining electric assistance, practical gearing and a space-saving folding frame, the Reid eMetro is a convenient option for city travel and leisure rides, particularly for riders who need a bike that is easier to store between journeys.\nThe Reid eMetro eBike is ideal for:\n\nUrban commuters, with electric assistance up to 15.5mph\n\nRiders with limited storage space, thanks to its folding design\n\nEveryday riders, with a 250W Ananda motor and 530Wh battery\n\nCyclists seeking versatile gearing, with a 7-speed drivetrain and Shimano rear derailleur\n\nRiders prioritising braking control, with Tektro hydraulic disc brakes\n\nConnected riders, with an Ananda D19 display featuring Bluetooth and app compatibility\n\nPlease make sure to familiarise yourself with eBike safety information before charging or using your new Reid. You can view and download the user manuals and safety instructions here.",
